\f1\fs22 \cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Tony\'92s thoughts dissolved into a cascade of fantasies. All he could feel was Sarah\'92s absence as pain in his chest. He should finish steam-cleaning. Instead, he found himself stalking down a hallway in search of her. He didn\'92t even feel his legs move. If only he could think of some blithering thing to say.\
